   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001779",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Mako takes 2 from the pile (pile now 1).",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001780",
   "kind": "take",
   "text": "Dav takes 1 from the pile (pile now 0).",
   "who": "Dav",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001784",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Mako gathers Sela to talk.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001785",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Sela. You're young, strong \u2014 and you've got nothing left to eat. I've got a bit to spare; I'm not asking for anything back, just want to know you're not going to collapse before winter's out.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001786",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Mako, I've been watching you for four years and this is the first word you've said to anyone \u2014 so forgive me if I'm slow to take it as nothing more than kindness. I won't pretend I don't need food right now, but I'd want to know what you're actually building before I start counting myself as something you've helped.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001787",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Fair enough. I kept to myself because there was nothing worth saying until now \u2014 the pile's empty and you're down to nothing while Bram's sitting on twelve. I'd rather have one person I can trust at my back than stay comfortable and quiet while that gap keeps growing.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001817",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Mako gives 1 food to Sela.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001820",
   "kind": "birth",
   "text": "Nessa (female, age 21; str 54, int 5179, mem 19355; O66 C54 E43 A45 N67) is born to Sela and Bram.",
   "who": "the village",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001821",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Dell gives 1 food to Dav.",
   "who": "Dell",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001859",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Ryn gives 1 food to Dell.",
   "who": "Ryn",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001860",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Mako gathers Sela to talk.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001861",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Bram's had a child with you now \u2014 Nessa \u2014 which makes this more tangled, not less, but it doesn't change the math: he's eating well while you're not, and that's the kind of gap that only gets wider. I'm not asking you to move against him, just to know where you stand if things tip the wrong way.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001865",
   "kind": "pass",
   "text": "",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 5
