   "who": "Eron",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002342",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Mako gathers Sela to talk.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002343",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "The pile went fast this year \u2014 you pulled early and smart. I've got six on me; I'm not worried about eating. Are you and Nessa sitting steady?",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002344",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Nessa's got four and Eron just handed me two more, so we'll eat \u2014 but I want to ask you something plain, Mako, because you've been talking to me and only me for three years now while you've said nothing to anyone else. What is it you're actually waiting for?",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002345",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "I'm waiting to see if you're the kind of person who asks that question and means it. You've got Nessa with Bram, which is a tie I don't want to cut \u2014 but I'm thirty-eight with no blood in this village, and that's the thing I think about most when the pile runs short. If you're asking because you want an honest answer, then yes \u2014 I'd want a child with you, if you'd have it.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002346",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Thirty-eight with no blood is a dangerous way to grow old here \u2014 I know that math, I've lived it. But Nessa ties me to Bram whether I like it or not, and a child with you on top of that makes me the thread every man in this village is pulling on. Tell me what you'd give her \u2014 not me, her \u2014 and I'll know whether you're thinking like a father or just like a man who wants to stop being alone.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002347",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Whatever we make together, I'd feed first \u2014 before myself. That's not a promise I'd make to anyone else in this village, and Sela knows I don't say things I don't mean.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002348",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "That's the thing about you, Mako \u2014 you've kept your word by staying quiet for three years, and that's a stranger kind of proof than most men offer. I've got two children already and a third would cost me food I'm counting close, but I'll say this much: if you're still sitting on six food and feeding the child before yourself when winter comes, I'll have a real answer for you then.",
   "who": "Sela",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002349",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Winter's still a ways off, but I won't make you wait that long to see \u2014 I'll give three food to start the child now, if you'll match it, and you'll watch how I carry it from the first day.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
