   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002448",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Zinn. I'm your father \u2014 that's not nothing, even if we only just met today. You've got three blood in your veins from this village: me, and through Sela, Nessa. Lean on that when things get thin.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002449",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Eron and Nessa are my blood too \u2014 four of us, not three. I've been watching out for them both and Sela's been feeding me; I know what family costs and I don't take it lightly.",
   "who": "Zinn",
   "year": 6
  },
  {
   "eid": "e002450",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "You're right \u2014 four, and I should have counted right the first time. Eron and Nessa, both. I'll be watching how the pile moves next year; you've got strength on you, and if it comes to a fight, I want us standing on the same side of it.",
   "who": "Mako",
   "year": 6
  },
